      "questionId": "qe-c05-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s02-p046-05662-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Like Raymond Carver, Jane Kenyon writes about her routines in her poem “Otherwise.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "69f3a6bffce6d3fc56707519649ad269eafa199104662398c486a3f169f9da83",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s02-p046-05662-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "a1a323e690fa05b7ef1417872b509af13e5a6e5e1a94eb581b4eabeaf05d1fc9",
      "passageSha256": "0ff628c161dee8a6c3c13598167e4b532446b0bd30fa3f905b3af04883c147b2",
      "pdfPages": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s02-p046-05662-s002",
      "sentenceText": "She gets out of bed, eats breakfast, has lunch, takes a nap, eats dinner, and sleeps.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0f44b6e2f7ada9f033347ef78001a417534309ac727cf9d0b9bf7cdc62280101",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s02-p046-05662-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "a1a323e690fa05b7ef1417872b509af13e5a6e5e1a94eb581b4eabeaf05d1fc9",
      "passageSha256": "0ff628c161dee8a6c3c13598167e4b532446b0bd30fa3f905b3af04883c147b2",
      "pdfPages": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s02-p046-05662-s006",
      "sentenceText": "It’s clear that she cherishes her mundane life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a3ace4fe8454b6da5a15c76c2204741836465c377a1a9d31bd52734e6ed2aa5e",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s02-p046-05662-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "26c80a190ab804419251754f08242e2dc44955dfb3b943383a2aca91b6d58824",
      "passageSha256": "54d7ae2508d36a02de4f0a148479fc642051ec3d2fab137db26d25081667f5f9",
      "pdfPages": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s02-p046-05662-s008",
      "sentenceText": "It is also a day you appreciate because “one day, I know, it will be otherwise.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "89c0b6a49571509534ebda71e2265a6f50dda80328194d43958dad9c0cdde92b",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s02-p046-05662-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "26c80a190ab804419251754f08242e2dc44955dfb3b943383a2aca91b6d58824",
      "passageSha256": "54d7ae2508d36a02de4f0a148479fc642051ec3d2fab137db26d25081667f5f9",
      "pdfPages": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s02-p047-00750-s001",
      "sentenceText": "What about a psychologically rich day?",
      "sentenceSha256": "67c89e2497761ac00bdc776f6451bc667e12a6a0bef07da254d35eefa9e5f371",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s02-p047-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "d8168b0d228c89538e15a5175e4c68fa86b565d897dd2726b34a5bd28626584d",
      "passageSha256": "40d9bb195fc09fdb6bced9ccf32c9607779f640a3931f814c803f2666cf10ff8",
      "pdfPages": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s02-p047-00750-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Mary Oliver in her poem “Wild Geese” tells us that we don’t have to be extraordinarily good or virtuous, that despair is a part of life, and that insignificance is a part of existence.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5451b743857a8ae2c0f3bb206f4e15d358939154062305d5e35813b575e53a42",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s02-p047-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "d8168b0d228c89538e15a5175e4c68fa86b565d897dd2726b34a5bd28626584d",
      "passageSha256": "40d9bb195fc09fdb6bced9ccf32c9607779f640a3931f814c803f2666cf10ff8",
      "pdfPages": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-02625-s001",
      "sentenceText": "I wondered whether the key factors of a happy day, a meaningful day, and a psychologically rich day that I identified based on the poems above actually make ordinary college students’ days happy, meaningful, or psychologically rich, respectively.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1ac0aa35bf31f9c608d508f555c7d8f84bc0424f4ca0473cf8c2ca23dae89144",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-02625-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-024",
      "parentFingerprint": "f590633bc4d26b78b44454a74d5d74893881bc00969c0a8627ef63967ad87b7e",
      "passageSha256": "a98c2b76dbbcf2238bb28dda45ee21566c73bdf8e6e19b1b6ef09cc7e837a826",
      "pdfPages": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-02625-s003",
      "sentenceText": "In addition to asking about happiness, meaning, and psychological richness, we asked them how typical or atypical each day was, how many routine activities they participated in, how much free time they had, and whether they did something new, met someone new, or ate something new.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e1a8fe6aaa7e1ebfdb5077730367211d752c3c5e16bb4f289661829197544591",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-02625-r003-005",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "e96459f132e5c8a446d00e4801e5a459734e34d8b1c49a8758853575b67404a9",
      "passageSha256": "c9343dd264ef44de5cd29d831f32d1408a4f62394705d4dac6ef041daf715471",
      "pdfPages": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-02625-s005",
      "sentenceText": "These daily reports gave us a nice picture of how the students spent their days.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1d1e27a89bc00a4be1bb0015e015b07d0ad49341b7a93557585ff84fd26d25fb",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-02625-r003-005",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "e96459f132e5c8a446d00e4801e5a459734e34d8b1c49a8758853575b67404a9",
      "passageSha256": "c9343dd264ef44de5cd29d831f32d1408a4f62394705d4dac6ef041daf715471",
      "pdfPages": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0045",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-05160-s001",
      "sentenceText": "First, we found some common factors associated with all three aspects of well-being.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f915a450f729cce27894f1e6ac4f79eee15e646cbccd4b9d91fae73d9450ed16",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-05160-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "e207236bbee56feacaf9b0aaf6551eb1aa718bea2f4dd27b1f9ed9b395ca363c",
      "passageSha256": "39beb0d49a470f1b90ec50b8538dc10d2a8317ae576e8b3cb41b4bcb1176d566",
      "pdfPages": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0046",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-05160-s002",
      "sentenceText": "It turned out that doing something new, eating something new, or meeting someone new enhanced not only psychological richness but also happiness and meaning.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5cbe24ac3b03965725628e0e658a48dccb2f6597a28be6310bd5b9261c5dcc01",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-05160-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "e207236bbee56feacaf9b0aaf6551eb1aa718bea2f4dd27b1f9ed9b395ca363c",
      "passageSha256": "39beb0d49a470f1b90ec50b8538dc10d2a8317ae576e8b3cb41b4bcb1176d566",
      "pdfPages": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0047",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-06330-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Second, we found some unique predictors of a psychologically rich day.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0adb9ebd7e54504cedbdaf1d31860a4760e1a0c9dced09eae2949a414f22125f",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-06330-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "af57931b7a7d5c173a86dbe9f05be1c11d3dd627be702034b458eb6849abdfd2",
      "passageSha256": "32effcd79f64cbeb1d733e949365c9a0c7e737d3917c5532dbc3e4e850e1eb43",
      "pdfPages": [
        47,
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0048",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-06330-s003",
      "sentenceText": "A day with more free time was psychologically richer than a day with less free time.",
      "sentenceSha256": "04cd8d1fc836564d65262d88e5a2bf35beaf35f4091e2602404a46871bf49763",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-06330-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "af57931b7a7d5c173a86dbe9f05be1c11d3dd627be702034b458eb6849abdfd2",
      "passageSha256": "32effcd79f64cbeb1d733e949365c9a0c7e737d3917c5532dbc3e4e850e1eb43",
      "pdfPages": [
        47,
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0049",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-06330-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Finally, a day with more required work was happier and more meaningful than a day with less required work.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1587454b9ff5b8828a6bf595e22bb01bf5d23ca571d23daf8a5f50a480f33e56",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-06330-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "4fef29ddafee7da70e582cd8b1845438e0f75c0d2665345a8585b9e4fcd09e9c",
      "passageSha256": "757a31fe3567a91553a741fe80bf5a05447f859d981a50a70a3b8edd61f868cd",
      "pdfPages": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0050",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p047-06330-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Whether you’re taking a short trip to a vineyard, walking in an unfamiliar part of town, going to a baseball game, or calling an old friend from elementary school, doing something that you don’t usually do is more interesting and psychologically rich than doing things you do every day.",
      "sentenceSha256": "887ef1a865091613fc60b1ff28805351c6ff457bea43e948c9502230a75d0217",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p047-06330-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "4fef29ddafee7da70e582cd8b1845438e0f75c0d2665345a8585b9e4fcd09e9c",
      "passageSha256": "757a31fe3567a91553a741fe80bf5a05447f859d981a50a70a3b8edd61f868cd",
      "pdfPages": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0051",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s03-p048-02310-s003",
      "sentenceText": "For example, if you are a liberal, watching Fox News might make you upset, but it would be more interesting than watching CNN or another network that more closely reflects your views.",
      "sentenceSha256": "937dce6a1883dfe3d54e30bb6f74c928bf29690beebb17d9aebcdbec2ed99f3d",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s03-p048-02310-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-029",
      "parentFingerprint": "e5e15730f28d5f3bfea678dae847554756b118d7d4ca69afdb718689936f847c",
      "passageSha256": "ca35de2c5cf920f2cdafddc0d1a0b001856a96e13be52f2c31bbcec189ca88a9",
      "pdfPages": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0052",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-04185-s001",
      "sentenceText": "If novelty, complexity, and perspective change are the key ingredients to psychological richness, studying abroad must rank near the top of the ranking of psychologically rich events.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9dc91b207f2cae57b89b754b58c916e6c3f375a82abdc789b86a7b0bf4511d3d",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-04185-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "d69f71266064fd9437c22a6a14e45701c85d281afe039f382c454b3e98d4c251",
      "passageSha256": "5f3a083fbd83a8003d8bfbb5e1c1cd306db169eadf4bad867f4a6515055e4fc0",
      "pdfPages": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0053",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Consequently, it is harder for students from a lower socioeconomic status to participate.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1201e67eb82c51f08fb4b8175a46d9084f7783ec8b01dc83c1907f524c12cfd2",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "464d9aee01a76f447f5bbcfdefcdb3eb049bcec155a07d98af8504d8a0e9bc0b",
      "passageSha256": "989f534e6f9978b9c67fb2f9bc1e69bb2d4714ddb172b50461339cc75fb486c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        48,
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0054",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-s007",
      "sentenceText": "When I got this scholarship, I asked my undergraduate advisor, Professor Hara, where I should go.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e20eb65ea345732cac74caceeaf3a484b056e3c4def1001288e1341abd1a8957",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "464d9aee01a76f447f5bbcfdefcdb3eb049bcec155a07d98af8504d8a0e9bc0b",
      "passageSha256": "989f534e6f9978b9c67fb2f9bc1e69bb2d4714ddb172b50461339cc75fb486c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        48,
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0055",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-s008",
      "sentenceText": "He was a big fan of liberal arts colleges and recommended three in Maine.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f1eddd3c60dadaf9d4a967b900bc1ff10e0efdacc18a29f1a2c431ed7dff984e",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-033",
      "parentFingerprint": "464d9aee01a76f447f5bbcfdefcdb3eb049bcec155a07d98af8504d8a0e9bc0b",
      "passageSha256": "989f534e6f9978b9c67fb2f9bc1e69bb2d4714ddb172b50461339cc75fb486c8",
      "pdfPages": [
        48,
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0056",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-s009",
      "sentenceText": "His assumption was that I would not see other Japanese students and would learn English best there.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0b68da9ddb06e4211af127fd1bf7a3c889d8b3ecb1518825c423855ac3fd0ca3",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-034",
      "parentFingerprint": "d26978c8b5c81193ee6020538cc6b22189020ecfe9b289250ad4217e41a3e16d",
      "passageSha256": "67e18c5eb55ffc55a8626bb595953ac66d9ecc04949968f22c3fe05ae52029e3",
      "pdfPages": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0057",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-s013",
      "sentenceText": "Dean James Reese picked me up at the airport and drove us up to Bates College in Lewiston.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e6194694128faa56500a3b530f41fc5b5bd78d1c6a5d5a8856444459699f05a2",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-r013-016",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-035",
      "parentFingerprint": "9970e4ac61c24945ee0c2f5c8bbba37eb947c2d77f3543688739ad8c966831e1",
      "passageSha256": "15681723e8bed301481bf989dead2b460e355b471828d89179be7dfa4e9ed81d",
      "pdfPages": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0058",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-s015",
      "sentenceText": "“What is your favorite music?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "8503bb2345ba583bb8cba98a530d1f386c91c53cd1aa0cd269ead57185e6e3de",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-r013-016",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-035",
      "parentFingerprint": "9970e4ac61c24945ee0c2f5c8bbba37eb947c2d77f3543688739ad8c966831e1",
      "passageSha256": "15681723e8bed301481bf989dead2b460e355b471828d89179be7dfa4e9ed81d",
      "pdfPages": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0059",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-s016",
      "sentenceText": "Dean Reese asked.",
      "sentenceSha256": "42b368395ebdbc19feee9fbffede0516cd084fdfe2b3105a05d5057efbcbcce5",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-r013-016",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-035",
      "parentFingerprint": "9970e4ac61c24945ee0c2f5c8bbba37eb947c2d77f3543688739ad8c966831e1",
      "passageSha256": "15681723e8bed301481bf989dead2b460e355b471828d89179be7dfa4e9ed81d",
      "pdfPages": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0060",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-s017",
      "sentenceText": "“Jazz,” I said.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3d085ff03a8c43cb93db2417224469f4fc7b80c3a6989b51b579b2a7d2b7f258",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p048-06525-r017-020",
